{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神弓箭雨"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","飞到空中对敌人进行连续射击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","亚莉克希飞到空中，对一名敌人快速地发射6波箭雨连击。每波箭雨附带3支箭且每箭造成100% + 10% ATK伤害，并额外附带敌人已损生命值5%的伤害，额外附带伤害至多不超过自身50% ATK。在空中时，亚莉克希处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":88,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每箭伤害提升至105% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每箭伤害提升至110% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每箭伤害提升至115% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每箭伤害提升至120% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","光翼权能"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，为友军赋予“光翼”权能，使其在造成若干次伤害后额外发射飞羽；主动释放时，造成高额伤害并击退击晕敌人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，亚莉克希将“光翼”权能赋予一名友军，使其在对敌人造成3次远程伤害时发射1枚飞羽，对敌人造成120% + 20% ATK伤害，每0.5秒至多触发一次。若拥有“光翼”权能的友军为远程角色还会额外提升5格普通攻击的攻击距离。亚莉克希优先选择同排最近的友军赋予权能，且这名友军会在被击败后失去权能。\n主动释放时，亚莉克希蓄力劲射，对一名敌人造成380% + 50% ATK的伤害，将其击退6格并击晕2.5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":176,"end":182,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":172,"end":186,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，伤害提升至420% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，伤害提升至460% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","圣辉索敌"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","锁定最远的敌人，并使“光翼”权能的友军和自身优先攻击这名敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，亚莉克希使用“辉煌圣瞳”锁定场上最远的敌人，使自身和“光翼”权能的友军优先对其进行攻击，并且对这名敌人造成的伤害额外提升35 + 5点穿透。\n被动地，亚莉克希连续锁定同一名敌人超过6秒或释放终极技能后，“辉煌圣瞳”得到强化，使亚莉克希对这名锁定的敌人造成伤害时，若这名敌人的生命值低于300% + 30% ATK会立刻将其击败。当敌人被击败或无法选中时，将会更换锁定目标并重置“辉煌圣瞳”的状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":152,"end":158,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":148,"end":162,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对这名敌人造成的伤害额外提升40 + 5点穿透。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对这名敌人造成的伤害额外提升45 + 5点穿透。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对这名敌人造成的伤害额外提升50 + 5点穿透。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中额外提升攻击力，并在击败锁定的敌人后额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升9%攻击力，“辉煌圣瞳”锁定的敌人首次被击败或无法选中后，亚莉克希和获得“光翼”权能的友军额外获得6%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升13%攻击力，“辉煌圣瞳”锁定的敌人首次被击败或无法选中后，亚莉克希和获得“光翼”权能的友军额外获得8%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升16%攻击力，“辉煌圣瞳”锁定的敌人首次被击败或无法选中后，亚莉克希和获得“光翼”权能的友军额外获得10%的攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","天护光翼"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身和获得“光翼”权能的友军能够免于首次被击败。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身和获得“光翼”权能的友军会在首次受到最后一击时，免疫这次伤害，进入1.5秒的无敌状态，并会回复30% HP，随后被带到4格内安全的位置。该效果无法移动处于霸体或稳定状态的友军。该效果每个英雄至多触发1次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":40,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":49,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":79,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":82,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复生命值提升至35% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复生命值提升至40% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“光翼”每发射4枚飞羽，便会引发1次光能爆炸，对1格范围的敌人造成330% ATK伤害，并施加致盲，持续3秒，期间敌人每秒失去40% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"},{"start":63,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“光翼”每发射一定数量的飞羽，会使自身终极技能获得额外的射击次数。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“光翼”每发射4枚飞羽，还会使本场战斗中亚莉克希后续释放“神弓箭雨”时会额外发射1波箭雨，通过这个方式至多增加6波箭雨。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","煊赫翼弓"]]}